                                "sense_id": "3118807d-6deb-340a-a5b9-14487f807567",
                                "text": "With the exception of college campuses — where I suspect you’ll be able to find Bob Marley posters for as long as dorms exist — it feels as if the old stoner subculture, the classic pothead aesthetic, has been almost eliminated from mainstream consciousness."
                            }
